  "2026-11-14T05:09:37.129Z",codex-toolchain-1114b,"Failure -> cause -> fix: bisect-commands.ts TS2532 on read.linked.tests.length -> pm-cli 2026.11.7 GH-1663 makes individual linked groups optional for nested projections -> retain the explicit full:true read and assert the documented full-read tests group at this use. No runtime default of omitted to empty is introduced. Existing real-tracker bisect tests cover empty and populated linked tests. Reverting this type-only assertion reproduces typecheck failure. Install exact pm-cli and pm-changelog 2026.11.13; regenerate changelog and text self-host archive after tracker writes."
  "2026-11-14T05:13:14.559Z",codex-toolchain-1114b,"Current typecheck passes after the type-only full-read assertion. Historical successful CI run 43492161862 measured test jobs at 94 and 177 minutes, exceeding the 45-minute local release budget; final npm/Bun release certification belongs to CI. Targeted real-tracker bisect checks, lint, duplication, docstrings, and self-host verification remain local evidence."
  "2026-11-14T05:13:55.133Z",codex-toolchain-1114b,"Focused bisect checks pass 2/2: 64-change first-failure diagnosis with state restoration, and complete start/action refusal corpus including the empty linked-test group. Typecheck passes, and reverting the type-only assertion reproduces TS2532. No runtime branch is changed. Complete bisect and repository coverage will be certified by the unchanged CI gates; local full release jobs exceed the 45-minute budget."
  "2026-11-14T08:00:32.223Z",codex-toolchain-1114b,"| Failure | Cause (changelog) | Fix |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| bisect linked.tests dereference fails typecheck TS2532 | pm-cli 2026.11.7 GH-1663 makes projected linked groups optional; full reads include every group | assert the full-read tests group without an omitted-to-empty default; retain real empty/populated bisect cases and regenerate the text self-host archive |\n\nProduction and test TypeScript compilation, lint, zero-duplication over 101 sources, and 616 documented declarations pass. Focused real-tracker bisect checks pass 2/2 (64-change diagnosis/restoration and refusal corpus including empty linked tests). Reverting the type-only full-read assertion in an isolated copy produces TS2532; restoration passes typecheck. No runtime branch changes and no omitted-to-empty default. Full local npm/Bun release checks are deferred to CI under the 45-minute budget: successful CI run 43492161862 measured 94 and 177 minutes for the test jobs. The prior committed text self-host archive passed source-byte equality; the required final archive is regenerated from staged source/evidence and independently verified after this tracker write and before push. No source scope, thresholds, assertions or seed counts changed."
